fix(nature-round): drop two unpublished rows from B's positive control

Jobs 3545604 and 3549233 both stopped on the cohort-flow rows while every
genuine target matched exactly. Those two rows were never published values:
402,119 traces to an unrelated Lp(a) diagnostic ("merged rows 402200 in-field
402119") and the 376 "dropped" is the residual 402,119 - 21,847 - 379,896.
The manuscript states no cohort flow at all. Both are now reported with no
target and no pass/fail; the real start is 401,743. The estimates and the
remaining counts stay hard stops. Recorded in PREREGISTERED_READOUT.md.

Also points the Lp(a) LDSC job at data/reference/ldsc_fixed/eur.*: the hm3
weights directory ships ldscore files with no .M/.M_5_50, which killed 3549578.

No real result of B exists yet.

